WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.412 --> 00:00:02.389
(laughing)

00:00:02.389 --> 00:00:03.791
- So, this was so much fun.

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:05.029
- Yeah, I had such a great time.

00:00:05.029 --> 00:00:05.879
It was great.

00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:06.745
And, I'll text ya.

00:00:06.745 --> 00:00:07.578
- Yeah?

00:00:07.578 --> 00:00:08.411
- [Guy] Yeah.

00:00:08.411 --> 00:00:09.244
- Okay.

00:00:09.244 --> 00:00:10.077
- Yeah, will do.

00:00:10.077 --> 00:00:11.056
Alright.

00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:11.889
- See ya.

00:00:13.994 --> 00:00:15.516
- Aww, you're leaving.

00:00:15.516 --> 00:00:17.035
- Yeah, I gotta get ready for work, but,

00:00:17.035 --> 00:00:19.345
maybe we can get lunch sometime soon?

00:00:19.345 --> 00:00:21.262
- Yeah, that'd be good.

00:00:22.794 --> 00:00:24.154
- I'm a big cannoli fan.

00:00:24.154 --> 00:00:25.157
- Alright, let's do it.

00:00:25.157 --> 00:00:26.050
Let's plan a menu around this.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.318
I'm having a really good time.

00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:28.906
- Me too.

00:00:28.906 --> 00:00:31.906
(upbeat funk music)

00:00:37.622 --> 00:00:40.289
(ominous music)

00:00:50.818 --> 00:00:52.381
- [Female] Something's happening.

00:00:52.381 --> 00:00:53.403
- I'm thinking...

00:00:53.403 --> 00:00:54.925
Fettucine Alfredo?

00:00:54.925 --> 00:00:57.895
(ominous music)

00:00:57.895 --> 00:00:59.560
- [Redhead] I can't explain it.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:00.558
- [Voicemail] It's Ben, leave a message.

00:01:00.558 --> 00:01:01.742
- I'm starting to worry.

00:01:01.742 --> 00:01:02.892
Should I call the police?

00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:04.320
- No, you're crazy.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:06.027
I'm sure he's just busy.

00:01:06.027 --> 00:01:08.430
- Look, we put this picture on Instagram

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:11.041
last night, and now he's gone from it.

00:01:11.041 --> 00:01:12.862
How do you explain that?

00:01:12.862 --> 00:01:16.668
- Maybe you just chose a bad filter?

00:01:16.668 --> 00:01:18.971
(horror movie music)

00:01:18.971 --> 00:01:20.887
- [Guy In Plaid Shirt] I thought
everything was going great.

00:01:20.887 --> 00:01:22.464
Was it something I did?

00:01:22.464 --> 00:01:23.918
Was it something about me?

00:01:23.918 --> 00:01:25.120
- It's not just me?

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:26.414
I thought I was alone.

00:01:26.414 --> 00:01:28.376
- Oh, it's been happening for years.

00:01:28.376 --> 00:01:29.966
- This is the first ghoster.

00:01:29.966 --> 00:01:31.011
- Oh my god.

00:01:31.011 --> 00:01:32.462
- This must go back
further than we thought.

00:01:32.462 --> 00:01:34.795
(screaming)

00:01:36.739 --> 00:01:39.194
- Guys, guys, come look at this.

00:01:39.194 --> 00:01:41.391
- Breaking news right
now, it's called Ghosting,

00:01:41.391 --> 00:01:43.504
and it's a new affliction
sweeping the nation.

00:01:43.504 --> 00:01:44.337
(sirens)

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:45.287
People in their 20s in
large cities have been

00:01:45.287 --> 00:01:46.120
the primary targets.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:47.529
- Oh my god.

00:01:47.529 --> 00:01:49.956
- Ape, where were you this weekend?

00:01:49.956 --> 00:01:51.500
Why didn't you return my calls?

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.415
- Oh, I was camping.

00:01:53.415 --> 00:01:55.273
I thought I told you.

00:01:55.273 --> 00:01:58.926
- You're not gonna like,
ghost on me, are you?

00:01:58.926 --> 00:02:00.322
- No.

00:02:00.322 --> 00:02:01.690
Of course not.

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.226
- Alright, let's take a picture for Snap.

00:02:04.226 --> 00:02:05.059
Not again!

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:10.377
- Check this out, his
Facebook is deactivated.

00:02:10.377 --> 00:02:11.375
- [Girl In Blue] Well
maybe he blocked you.

00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:12.745
- Hey, he liked my status!

00:02:12.745 --> 00:02:14.401
But he can't respond to my text?

00:02:14.401 --> 00:02:16.565
- What am I supposed to do now?

00:02:16.565 --> 00:02:17.828
Go to the movies alone?

00:02:17.828 --> 00:02:19.881
I already bought the tickets!

00:02:19.881 --> 00:02:21.278
- Nothing makes any sense!

00:02:21.278 --> 00:02:22.706
- What do you mean she just vanished?

00:02:22.706 --> 00:02:23.914
That's impossible.

00:02:23.914 --> 00:02:25.063
- Look, I know what I saw.

00:02:25.063 --> 00:02:26.138
Why won't you believe me?

00:02:26.138 --> 00:02:27.140
- You're crazy!

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.674
(grunts)

00:02:28.674 --> 00:02:31.681
- [Redhead] What if, this is
all happening because people

00:02:31.681 --> 00:02:33.562
are afraid of commitment
and confrontation?

00:02:33.562 --> 00:02:35.698
(wind whistling)

00:02:35.698 --> 00:02:38.948
(wind chimes tinkling)

00:02:40.783 --> 00:02:43.116
(screaming)

00:02:48.551 --> 00:02:50.859
- You know, I've been on a
couple dates with this girl,

00:02:50.859 --> 00:02:52.451
but I'm just not really feeling it.

00:02:52.451 --> 00:02:53.455
- Oh god.

00:02:53.455 --> 00:02:54.458
- What?

00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:55.458
- No, no!

00:02:55.458 --> 00:02:56.579
- Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no!

00:02:56.579 --> 00:02:58.430
(screaming)

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:01.135
(high pitched beep)

00:03:01.135 --> 00:03:02.807
(ominous music)

00:03:02.807 --> 00:03:04.943
(creaking of door)

00:03:04.943 --> 00:03:06.430
- That's the only
reasonable explanation why

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:08.612
she hasn't called me back.

00:03:08.612 --> 00:03:10.539
- Yeah dude, you're probably right.

00:03:10.539 --> 00:03:13.872
(creepy keyboard music)

00:03:17.654 --> 00:03:19.850
(screeching of dry erase marker)

